      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BEELINE (2) has a strong record this track and trip with two wins and three placings from six starts. Placed last time (24.43) at Traralgon in a Grade 4/5, finishing third and beaten 4 lengths. With a clean break looks hard to beat. ASTON PROTON (4) turned spotting a big start finishing eighth (26.68) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Has a strong winning record here. Leading chance. OPALINA (5) is mixing form, finishing out of the placings latest but was a winner three back and returns to Warragul this time where she has performed well. Expecting significant improvement. VALLETTA MOON (7) comes here off a freshen-up and deserves plenty of thought.",
